---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import somdet from '../assets/about/somdet.png';
import Divider from './Divider.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<section class="founder-band" id="about-founder">
  <div class="container founder">
    <Image
      src={somdet}
      alt="Somdet Phra Nyanavajirodom (Luang Phor Viriyang Sirintharo)"
      widths={[400, 774]}
      sizes="(min-width: 900px) 520px, 90vw"
      class="founder__portrait"
    />
    <div class="founder__text">
      <h2 class="founder__title">
        About Somdet Phra Nyanavajirodom
        <span class="founder__alt">(Phra Ajarn Luangphor Viriyang Sirintharo)</span>
      </h2>
      <p>
        Somdet Phra Nyanavajirodom (Luang Phor Viriyang Sirintharo) was ordained as a novice monk on October 22, 1935,
        at the age of 15. He accompanied Phra Ajarn Kongma on meditation pilgrimages (tudong) to various places for a
        period of eight years.
      </p>
      <p>
        During that time, he was fully ordained as a monk on May 20, 1941, at the age of 20. One day, Phra Ajarn Kongma
        led him on a pilgrimage where they met Phra Ajarn Mun Bhuridatta. Luang Phor Viriyang was chosen to serve as
        Phra Ajarn Mun’s attendant for four years during the rains retreats and five years outside the rains retreats,
        a total of nine years.
      </p>
      <p>
        He practiced tudong and meditation alongside Phra Ajarn Mun, studying meditation and profound Dhamma. Later, he
        disseminated this meditation knowledge to the public through the Willpower Institute, which he founded on July
        24, 1997, at Wat Dhammamongkol.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="teaching" id="about-courses">
  <div class="container">
    <figure class="quote">
      <blockquote>{site.quote}</blockquote>
    </figure>
    <Divider />
    <div class="teaching__text">
      <h2>About our meditation courses</h2>
      <p>
        All Meditation Courses of the Willpower Institute Foundation are based on the teachings of Somdet Phra
        Nyanavajirodom Phra Ajarn Luang Phor Viriyang Sirintharo — the late and highly revered Thai Buddhist monk,
        Abbot of Wat Dhammamongkol, meditation master, and founder of the Willpower Institute Foundation.
      </p>
      <p>
        The meditation methods originate from the direct lineage of his teacher, Luangpu Mun Bhuridatta, a renowned
        Vipassana meditation master in the Thai Forest monastic tradition.
      </p>
      <p>
        The Willpower Institute Foundation aims to teach meditation with an emphasis on Samma-Samadhi (Right
        Meditation). Learning meditation and accumulating mind power bring great benefits and help cultivate virtues.
        Meditation promotes reason, responsibility, and loving-kindness. Those who practice meditation will experience
        benefits both physically and mentally.
      </p>
      <p class="signature">
        Willpower Institute Foundation<br />Luangphor Viriyang Sirintharo
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .founder-band {
    padding-block: var(--section-gap);
    background: var(--palm);
  }
  .founder {
    display: grid;
    gap: 36px 72px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .founder {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
    .founder :global(.founder__portrait) {
      position: sticky;
      top: 96px;
    }
  }
  .founder :global(.founder__portrait) {
    width: min(520px, 100%);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .founder__title {
    font-size: clamp(30px, 3.6vw, 40px);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .founder__alt {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 0.56em;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--kasaya);
  }
  .founder__text p {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    max-width: 62ch;
  }

  .teaching {
    padding-block: var(--section-gap);
  }
  .quote {
    margin: 0 auto 36px;
    max-width: 760px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .quote blockquote {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3.6vw, 40px);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--forest);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .teaching__text {
    max-width: 660px;
    margin: 44px auto 0;
  }
  .teaching__text h2 {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 36px);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .teaching__text p {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }
  .signature {
    margin-top: 30px !important;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--kasaya);
  }
</style>
